# 15. DASHBOARD PERFORMANCE AND SECURITY

NEXORA may support a large number of employees and simultaneous hardware events.

Ensure:

- Dashboard queries remain efficient.
- Reports use server-side aggregation.
- Large datasets are paginated.
- Chart APIs return only required data.
- No unnecessary full employee list is downloaded.
- Dashboard data is refreshed appropriately.
- Cached information, where used, is permission-aware and invalidated when relevant data changes.
- User A cannot access User B's restricted dashboard information.
- Department-restricted users cannot access another department's data.
- Employee users cannot access company-wide performance records without permission.

Do not implement a frontend-only security model.

